---
const beliefs = [
  ['Problem before technology.','Start with what needs solving—not what technology happens to be fashionable.'],
  ['Depth before assumptions.','The better we understand a problem, the better we can understand what deserves to be built.'],
  ['Build to learn.','Ideas become useful when they meet reality.'],
  ['Outcomes over outputs.','What changes matters more than what we produce.'],
  ['Stay curious.',"The next important problem may come from somewhere we didn't expect."],
];
---
<div class="co-sub co-team">
  <section class="co-sub-hero"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-sub-hero-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE WORK</p><h1>Different minds.<br/><em>Shared ownership.</em></h1><p class="co-lead">A team built around curiosity, responsibility, and the willingness to do the work required to make meaningful progress.</p></div><div class="co-team-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="co-orbit co-orbit-a"></div><div class="co-orbit co-orbit-b"></div><div class="co-core">E<span>.</span></div><small>ONE SHARED DIRECTION</small></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section"><div class="co-sub-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">HOW WE WORK TOGETHER</p><div class="co-sub-heading"><h2>Good work needs<br/><em>more than good ideas.</em></h2><p>It takes people who can move between asking why, understanding what is happening, and making something better.</p></div><div class="co-principles">{beliefs.map((item,i)=><article><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{item[0]}</h3><p>{item[1]}</p></div><b>↗</b></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section co-sub-tint"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-story-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">OUR STORY, IN BRIEF</p><h2>Built because<br/><em>important problems deserve builders.</em></h2></div><div><p>E Deviser is a problem-solving company built around a simple belief: important problems deserve the curiosity, depth, and determination to find better ways forward.</p><p>We started E Deviser to build—not simply advise, observe, or wait for someone else to solve the difficult problems we care about.</p><p>When a problem matters, understanding it deeply is only the beginning. We should be willing to build, test, learn, and keep going until we find something that works.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-story-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">OUR PHILOSOPHY</p><h2>What matters is<br/><em>what changes.</em></h2></div><div><p>We believe meaningful progress comes from getting close to the problem, understanding what makes it difficult, bringing the right people and capabilities together, and having the courage to build something new.</p><p>We challenge assumptions, get close to the details, and stay open to changing our minds when the evidence tells us to. We value people who can move between ideas and execution—people who do not just ask what is possible, but what is worth doing.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section co-sub-tint"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-people"><div><p class="co-kicker">THE PEOPLE</p><h2>People make<br/><em>the work possible.</em></h2><p>Different perspectives. Different disciplines. One shared expectation: if something matters, we should be willing to do the work to make it better.</p></div><div class="co-people-note"><span>TEAM PROFILES</span><strong>Built by people who care deeply about the problems they take on.</strong><small>Confirmed names, roles, and biographies will be added when approved. No invented profiles.</small></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section co-sub-end"><div class="co-sub-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">BUILD WITH US</p><h2>Bring your perspective.<br/><em>Make something matter.</em></h2><a class="co-pill" href="/company/careers-contact/">Careers &amp; contact ↗</a></div></section>
</div>
<style>
.co-sub{--sub-bg:var(--brand-ink);--sub-text:var(--color-text-inverse);--sub-muted:var(--color-text-inverse-muted);--sub-line:var(--color-border-inverse);background:var(--sub-bg);color:var(--sub-text);overflow:hidden}.co-sub *{box-sizing:border-box}.co-sub-wrap{width:min(88rem,calc(100% - 3rem));margin:auto}.co-sub-section{padding:clamp(4.5rem,8vw,8rem) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-sub-tint{background:var(--color-surface-night-raised)}.co-kicker{margin:0 0 1.5rem;color:var(--brand-teal-light);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-xs);font-weight:var(--weight-bold);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-wide);text-transform:uppercase}.co-sub h1,.co-sub h2{margin:1rem 0 1.5rem;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5.5vw,5.6rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.06em}.co-sub h1 em,.co-sub h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--text-on-dark-accent)}.co-sub p{color:var(--sub-muted);line-height:1.8}.co-sub-hero{padding:clamp(5rem,9vw,9rem) 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 45%,#0382bd25,transparent 40%)}.co-sub-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:center}.co-lead{max-width:39rem;font-size:1.08rem}.co-team-art{height:25rem;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--sub-line);background:radial-gradient(circle,#0382bd25,transparent 55%)}.co-core{width:7rem;height:7rem;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--color-surface-night-hover);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-teal) 46.7%, transparent);font:800 4rem var(--font-display);box-shadow:0 0 60px color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-blue) 18.8%, transparent)}.co-core span{color:var(--text-on-dark-accent)}.co-orbit{position:absolute;width:72%;height:36%;border:1px solid var(--brand-teal)55;border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(-28deg)}.co-orbit-b{transform:rotate(42deg);width:60%;height:58%;border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-on-dark-accent) 27%, transparent)}.co-team-art small{position:absolute;bottom:1.5rem;font:500 .58rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--brand-teal-light)}.co-sub-heading,.co-story-grid,.co-people{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:center}.co-sub-heading>p,.co-story-grid>div:last-child{max-width:38rem}.co-principles{margin-top:3rem;border-top:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-principles article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr 2rem;gap:1.2rem;align-items:center;padding:1.5rem .3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-principles article>span{font:600 .65rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-on-dark-accent)}.co-principles h3{font-size:1.35rem;margin:0}.co-principles p{margin:.4rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem}.co-principles article>b{color:var(--text-on-dark-accent);font-weight:400}.co-story-grid h2,.co-people h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.4vw,4.6rem)}.co-story-grid a{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;color:var(--brand-teal-light);text-decoration:none;font-weight:650;font-size:.85rem}.co-people-note{padding:2.5rem;border:1px solid var(--sub-line);background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 10%,color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-blue) 13.3%, transparent),transparent 60%)}.co-people-note span,.co-people-note small{display:block;font:500 .6rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--text-on-dark-accent)}.co-people-note strong{display:block;margin:2rem 0;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.4}.co-people-note small{color:var(--color-text-inverse-muted);line-height:1.7}.co-sub-end{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 55%,color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-blue) 13.3%, transparent),transparent 48%)}.co-pill{display:inline-flex;margin-top:1rem;padding:.85rem 1.3rem;border:1px solid var(--brand-teal);border-radius:99px;color:var(--brand-teal-light);text-decoration:none;font-size:.85rem}.co-sub-end h2{margin-bottom:2rem}
@media(max-width:760px){.co-sub-hero-grid,.co-sub-heading,.co-story-grid,.co-people{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.co-team-art{height:19rem}.co-sub-wrap{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.co-sub *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>